#
# Extension modules built INTO the interpreter. There is no dlopen on
# this machine, so nothing can be loaded at run time: what is not here
# is not there at all.
#
# configure already marks every module static when it finds no dynamic
# loading; this file is where a module needing a library of ours goes.
*static*
